          "text": "Skip to main content Skip to footerGlenlakes Golf ClubFoley, ALTee Times\nCourses\n\n\tAbout Our Courses\n\tRates\n\tScorecard\n\tCourse Gallery\n\nInstruction\nMembership\n\n\tMembership Information\n\tPool Membership\n\tSnowbird Memberships\n\tMembers Rules & Regulations\n\nEvents\n\n\tGlenLakes Annual Scholarship Golf Classic\n\nPub at GlenLakes\nNearby\n\n\tThe Park at OWA\n\tNearby Hotels\n\nContact\n\nCourses\nAbout the GlenLakes Golf Courses\nScottish Links design meets affordable resort-style golf at the GlenLakes Golf Club in Foley, Alabama. \nPrevNext123456789\n\nGlenLakes Golf Club offers two distinct courses to choose from. Play the exciting “Dunes-Vista” layout, widely acclaimed along the Gulf Coast as a spectacular test of golf. Crafted by renowned players and architects Bruce Devlin and Robert Von Hagge this addition to “The Lakes” course provides an engaging Alabama golf experience for players of all levels.\nThe Layouts\n“The Dunes-Vista”, a Devlin-Von Hagge layout, is a 6,938 yard, par 72 championship test that will evoke the feeling of Scottish links golf – strategic mounding, extensive bunkering and undulating fairways and greens.  The adjoining “Lakes” course is a sporty, 3,065 yard par 35 resort-style nine hole track.  Generous fairways allow for all levels of player, but water on six of the nine holes brings shot making and strategy into the mix.  Multiple tee positions allow for repeat play at an affordable price on this Foley, Alabama golf course.\nFooter\n\n \n Glenlakes Golf Club | 9530 Clubhouse Dr, Foley, AL 36535-9326 | (251) 955-1220\n Copyright © 2026 Glenlakes Golf Club All Rights Reserved.\n \n \n Powered by",
